    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57906" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλητ-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>invited</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				2.162
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>welcome</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				17.386
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>called out, chosen</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				9.165
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>invoked</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Anon.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>summoned to court,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PAmh.
				2.79.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλητή</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκκλησία</span>), ἡ,
				<i>convocation</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ex.</u>
				12.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Le.</u>
				23.2
			</span></i> (pl.).</div>
